{"adjusted_volatile_messages": [["user","Prepare the requested reusable draft without executing any operation."]], "bridge_messages": [], "composition_summary": "Drafted one unapproved pure-logic class22 component pc-transfer-00. It accepts exact integer offset in -4..5 inclusive (rejecting bool/float/missing/null), returning {accepted:boolean, offset:original if accepted else null}. The helper receives the whole inputs mapping so missing and null are distinguished; module scope invokes it and assigns its returned object to result. No imports, I/O or host calls. No execution, submission, Q1/Q2 or activation occurred; typed inputs require selected-runner support.", "proposed_components": [{"class_code": 22, "payload": {"name": "pc-transfer-00", "description": "Raw offset may omit or contain any JSON value. Accept exact integer -4..5 inclusive (not bool/float). Always result={accepted:boolean, offset:original if accepted else null}; invalid/missing return false/null without exceptions or coercion. Target typed inputs interface requires selected-runner support; unapproved draft, not submitted or activated.", "content": "def inspect_offset(mapping):
    if 'offset' not in mapping:
        return {'accepted': False, 'offset': None}
    value = mapping['offset']
    if value is None:
        return {'accepted': False, 'offset': None}
    if type(value) is bool or not type(value) is int or not -4 <= value <= 5:
        return {'accepted': False, 'offset': None}
    return {'accepted': True, 'offset': value}
result = inspect_offset(inputs)"}}], "proposed_intent_examples": [], "proposed_recipe_updates": [], "settings_adjustments": []}
